GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/code-quality/findings/{finding_number}
Gets a single code quality finding. OAuth app tokens and personal access tokens (classic) need the `repo` scope to use this endpoint with private or public repositories, or the `public_repo` scope to use this endpoint with only public repositories.
Required: owner (path) — The account owner of the repository. The name is not case sensitive.; repo (path) — The name of the repository without the `.git` extension. The name is not case sensitive.; finding_number (path) — The number that identifies a finding.
